      "hizbQuarter": 205,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4604,
      "text": "And there are other [spoils] that you have not yet been able to gain, but Allah has full control over them[12], for Allah is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
